@startuml sequence-scn-009-ai-task-tracker
' T-034 R-01 — SCN-009: S-04 day-view model column
' Trace: SCN-009 ↔ UC-E2E-005 | API: API-001 | R-015
' Source: requirements R-015, ui-spec S-04 day view, UC-E2E-005
autonumber
title SCN-009 — S-04 day-view model column (UC-E2E-005)

actor "User" as user
participant "CalendarDayView (S-04)" as dayview
participant "ModelCell (CLS-005)\nshared model cell" as cell
participant "api (Spring REST)" as api
participant "store (JPA / PG16)" as pg

user -> dayview : open /calendar/2026-11-11 (S-04 «День»)
dayview -> api : GET /api/tasks?from=2026-11-11&to=2026-11-11 (API-001)
api -> pg : select tasks + token_usage rows (date, ordered models)
pg --> api : TASK-003/004/005 + usage by model (qwen3.8:27b, llama3.1:8b)
api --> dayview : 200 {items:[{task_id,name,started_at,finished_at,status,duration_s,tokens_total,models}]}
note over dayview, cell
  «Модель» column placed immediately after «Задача» (R-015);
  data comes from the existing API-001 `models` array (R-014) —
  no new endpoint, no schema change
end note
dayview -> cell : render(models) for each task row
note over cell
  ModelCell (CLS-005) shared by S-01 (R-014) + S-04 (R-015):
  primary = models[0] «qwen3.8:27b»; `+N` = «+1» (2 models);
  `title`/`aria-label` = full ordered list «qwen3.8:27b, llama3.1:8b»;
  empty models → «Нет данных» (TASK-002 on 10.11)
end note
user -> dayview : navigate to 10.11 (day)
dayview -> api : GET /api/tasks?from=2026-11-10&to=2026-11-10 (API-001)
api --> dayview : 200 TASK-001 (models 2), TASK-002 (models [])
dayview -> cell : render(models)
note over cell
  TASK-001: «qwen3.8:27b» + «+1», full list in title/aria;
  TASK-002: `models` empty → «Нет данных» (R-015)
end note
user -> dayview : click TASK-004
note over dayview : link → S-02 detail (UC-E2E-003)
@enduml
